        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare mitochondrial disease characterized by early infantile onset of progressive neurological deterioration with seizures spasticity and lack of psychomotor development. Brain imaging shows severe leukodystrophy and abnormalities of neuronal migration. Lactic acidosis is common. The disease is usually fatal in early childhood."
        },
